<title>USA: ARI Network acquires catalog company.</title>
<headline>ARI Network acquires catalog company.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARI Network Services Inc, a provider of Internet electronic commerce services, said it completed the acquisition of  cd.IMG Inc, known to its customers by the trademark of its electronic parts cataloging software PLUS1.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquisition of PLUS1, based in New Berlin, Wis., strengthens ARI's market position and product offering in the outdoor power and recreational vehicle segments of the equipment industry.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
